Snappy Java native components
-----------------------------
The JNI binding uses Apache-2.0. Its native libraries embed Snappy (BSD-3-Clause),
Bitshuffle (MIT), and statically linked GCC runtime code covered by the GCC
Runtime Library Exception. Full original notices, terms and exception are in
licenses/LICENSE.snappy-java; applicable upstream notifications are in NOTICE.
The Hadoop 2 JAR is snappy-java 1.1.8.4; its build recipe targets
Snappy 1.1.8 and Bitshuffle 0.3.2. The Hadoop 3 JAR is snappy-java 1.1.10.5;
its build recipe targets Snappy 1.1.10 and Bitshuffle 0.3.4. The publisher
retains older platform prebuilts, so these are not uniform per-platform versions.
